          "snippet": {
            "line": 31,
            "text": "theorem exteriorProfile_iteratedDerivWithin (C : ℝ) {h : ℝ} (hh : 0 < h)\n    (n : ℕ) {y : ℝ} (hy : 0 ≤ y) :\n    iteratedDerivWithin n (exteriorProfile C h) (Ici 0) y =\n      (C * (2 : ℝ) ^ (1 / 2 + h)) * (4 : ℝ) ^ n *\n        iteratedDerivWithin n (RadialHeatProfile.profile (1 + h)) (Ici 0) (4 * y)"
          }
